    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2a4e1bfc-7ad0-5e97-91da-83aa03379536" activityNameId="a30a7204-3150-5f32-a968-8ec4f2f0e1dc" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Substation,offshore, 150MW offshore wind farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Substation,offshore, 150MW offshore wind farm
UUID=2add76f7-8cfd-36e4-bb6c-294fc443f5e1
Offshore substation of a 150 MW offshore wind farm. Included processes: manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the Ormonde offshore wind farm, UK, consisting of 30 wind turbines with a nominal capacity of 5 MW.

Main data source for material composition: 
Kouloumpis, V., &amp; Azapagic, A. (2022). A model for estimating life cycle environmental impacts of offshore wind electricity considering specific characteristics of wind farms. Sustainable Production and Consumption, 29, 495–506. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.spc.2021.10.024
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2add76f7-8cfd-36e4-bb6c-294fc443f5e1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
